# Committed on purpose.
#
# Whether the live-Claude endpoint is connected should be answerable by reading
# the repository, not by inspecting CI settings. Empty means the instrument
# degrades to its "available on request" state and makes no network calls, so
# every clone and fork is dark by default and cannot spend anyone's API credit.
#
# This is the endpoint's public URL, not a secret. VITE_* variables are compiled
# into the client bundle and are public by construction; the Anthropic API key
# lives in the endpoint host's environment and never appears here.
#
# Turning it on is a one-line change with its own commit. Treat that commit as
# going live.
VITE_REFLECT_ENDPOINT=
